{
  "case_id": "MEGAS-REG-1.20.1",
  "title": "机械师立牌(megas)注册与装配取证：stand 槽装入后产品 isEquipped=1；冷却键脚手架 present 档读到 60 秒窗口(2400t)、fresh 档归零；佩戴态冷却常量 cd_cfg=2400（120s 基础，无减免源）。本用例不触发轰炸（无靶），只做注册面与状态键基线。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "new",
    "ref": "megas_sign"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：机械师立牌(megas)「轨道轰炸 / 物资补充 / 精准打击」游戏内取证。\n本用例组由探针 megas* 系列驱动，**只调产品公开函数**（MegasSignItem / OrbitalBombardmentManager / PrecisionStrikeEffect / ModAttachments），断言锚定 latest.log 的 AP_<tag>_MEGAS 机器行。\n\n**期望值均按产品常量独立推算**（不读产品的中间量）：RADIUS=12、BASE_DAMAGE=2、MAX_STRIKES=10、\nPRECISION_THRESHOLD=6、COST_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER=1、STRIKE_INTERVAL=10t、FALL=8t、合计单轮约 18t；\n主动冷却 120s=2400t；被动间隔 1200t、阈值 6 张。\n  次数 strikes = min(floor(消耗卡牌数 / 2), 10)；\n  单轮伤害 = BASE(2) + 战斗牌费用总和 x1；若有「精准打击」则该轮再 + 当前层数；\n  总伤害 = strikes x per + (precision ? strikes x (strikes+1)/2 : 0)。\n\n**场景控制**：doMobSpawning false（仅本用例内，末尾恢复）避免自然刷怪混入目标池；\n探针读数里的 near（指定靶 12 格内存活实体数）恒应为 1 —— 若被污染则**响亮失败**，\n不把伤害平摊当成功。\n\nWARN 冷却写在 TargetSelectionAction#apply 内 => 只有 megascast confirm 档能验冷却；\nWARN 轰炸异步（每轮 10t 间隔 + 8t 下落）=> 伤害/层数必须在用例侧 wait 之后读。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "第 1 步：装配立牌（探针 equipSign 走 Curios stand 槽）+ 冷却键脚手架往返。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasprep RG0 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascd RG1 present",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascd RG2 fresh",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread RG3 REG",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasclear ZZ9",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RG0_MPREP:phase=prep:equipped=1:hand=[0-9]+:cd_end=0:cd_rem=0:cd_max=0:cd_cfg=2400:[^\\n]*:near_ok=0:far_ok=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RG1_MCD:phase=cd_present:equipped=1:[^\\n]*:cd_rem=2[0-9]{3}:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RG2_MCD:phase=cd_fresh:equipped=1:[^\\n]*:cd_end=0:cd_rem=0:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_RG3_MEGAS:phase=REG:equipped=1:[^\\n]*:cd_end=0:cd_rem=0:[^\\n]*:cd_cfg=2400:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_ZZ9_MCLEAR:cleared=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_ERR"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_EX:"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "Unknown or incomplete command|Incorrect argument for command|Expected whitespace to end one argument|Unknown command|Expected literal|Unclosed quoted string|Expected quote to start a string|Invalid (integer|long|double|float|bool|escape sequence)|Expected (integer|long|double|float|bool)|<--\\[|错误的命令参数"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "redeclared|redeclaration of var"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ],
  "evidence": []
}
